<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oregon Steel change explained.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oregon Steel change explained.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Bob Schenosky said he raised the rating on Oregon Steel Mills Inc to near-term buy from near-term accumulate because the stock was below the rest of the steel mini-mill sector, and was trading at a historic low.</p>
<p>-- said there was no fundamental reason for the low stock price.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 7/8 to 16-3/8.</p>
</text>
